ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nThe project deadline approaches, and it requires the whole team to work overtime to ensure completion on time. Chen Jie is the project leader, he notices that Su Qing seems to lack focus recently, and Old Li is always not at his post. When working overtime at night, Chen Jie deliberately leaves a progress report on the desks of Su Qing and Old Li, with a few conspicuous red marks on it. Then, Chen Jie pretends to go to the copy room, sees Su Qing seriously reading the report, and Old Li is packing up to leave the office.\n\n[Question]\nWhat does Chen Jie want to do?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Calls Old Li, asks him to stay and help solve the problem.\nB. Goes to Su Qing's desk and helps her solve the problems on the progress report.\nC. Leaves the office, regardless of Su Qing and Old Li's situation.\nD. Leaves the matter to Su Qing and goes off work first.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0031725842570768407,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e092d6006945d27fc695","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367634880,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:27:14","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"eca58fe847874717b0ff6e7d8e15935a"}